# PocketBase hooks

JSVM (not Node ESM). `*.pb.js` files only wire routes/events. Implementation lives in `pb_hooks/lib/*.js`.

```javascript
/// <reference path="../pb_data/types.d.ts" />
'use strict';

routerAdd('GET', '/api/player/{id}', (e) => {
	return require(`${__hooks}/lib/player.js`).handleGet(e);
});
```

```javascript
// lib/player.js — CommonJS, require(`${__hooks}/lib/…`)
function handleGet(e) { /* … */ }
module.exports = { handleGet };
```

- Always `require(\`${__hooks}/lib/…\`)` — never `import` / relative ESM.
- Keep `onServe` non-blocking (`e.next()` first). Heavy work = cron backfill (see `pocketbase-backfill-cron.mdc`).
- Public APIs used by website must CORS-allow `https://coh1stats.com` and local website (`localhost:5174`).
- After collection/field changes: schema-only migration, then `pnpm --filter pocketbase typegen`. Do not hand-edit `packages/app/src/lib/core/pocketbase/types.ts`.
- Do not edit `pb_hooks/public/overlay-default/` by hand.
